# Hallucination blocklist
#
# Whisper learned from subtitled videos, so it sometimes makes up subtitle
# studio names or sign off phrases during silence. The VAD handles most of
# this; this list is the second line of defense for the rest.
#
# Comparison ignores accents and punctuation, using partial match:
# if the line appears anywhere in the sentence, the sentence is dropped.
# Be careful with short patterns, since they can filter out real text too.

